# Bot1 plays Strip Mine on turn one and casts Crucible of Worlds off a Black Lotus. On turn three it sacrifices the
# Strip Mine to destroy Bot2's only land, and then plays that same Strip Mine again straight out of its graveyard,
# using the turn's one land play (CR 305.1, 305.2). Bot2 is left with nothing on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Strip Mine
Black Lotus
Crucible of Worlds
Swamp x4
Swamp x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Crucible of Worlds.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Strip Mine.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Island; Ability: Destroy)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Strip Mine)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Strip Mine; Black Lotus
Bot1.Graveyard.Strip Mine.Play

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Battlefield = Crucible of Worlds; Strip Mine
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Island
